# Moonshot / Kimi Open Platform's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-moonshot-setting-api-key = Moonshot / Kimi 开放平台 API 密钥，可从 https://platform.moonshot.ai/console/api-keys（国际站）或 https://platform.moonshot.cn/console/api-keys（中国大陆站）获取。请使用下方所选区域签发的密钥。
usage-moonshot-setting-region = 签发密钥的平台："international"（默认，api.moonshot.ai，余额单位为美元）或 "china"（api.moonshot.cn，余额单位为人民币）。

## The report: the prepaid balance and its voucher and cash parts. Amounts
## (such as $46.59) stay as figures.

usage-moonshot-available = 可用
usage-moonshot-balance = 余额
usage-moonshot-voucher = 代金券
usage-moonshot-cash = 现金
# How far the cash balance is below zero.
usage-moonshot-in-deficit = 欠费
